		<name>Caminho enjoyable</name>
		<adjective>hedonist</adjective>
		<memberName>Hedonist</memberName>
		<leaderTitleMale>Wayfarer gratifying</leaderTitleMale>
		<leaderTitleFemale>Wayfarer gratifying</leaderTitleFemale>
		<description>"Have you ever been to a crowded city? Even the greatest human cities are cesspools of disease, violence, corruption. It is abundantly clear that Pleasure is not a need, but an incentive. A poor man is a defenseless man, and the Rim is not a place for weaklings."

  - Trisha 'Elvee' Miller, just before execution</description>
		<descriptionTemplate>"Have you ever been to a crowded city? Even the greatest human cities are cesspools of disease, violence, corruption. It is abundantly clear that Pleasure is not a need, but an incentive. A poor man is a defenseless man, and the Rim is not a place for weaklings."

  - Trisha 'Elvee' Miller, just before execution</descriptionTemplate>
